{"company":{"id":"shopify","name":"Shopify","accent":"#96bf48","asset":"store pages","verb":"checkout"},"nodes":[{"id":"client","title":"Customer app","kind":"client","blurb":"Search, book/order, track.","depth":0,"story":"This is the Shopify app on your phone or laptop. Tapping checkout starts here. The app does not hold the whole product — it only starts the request."},{"id":"supply","title":"Supply app","kind":"client","blurb":"Driver, host, or merchant app.","depth":0,"story":"The other side of Shopify: driver, host, or shop. Same company, different app, same front door."},{"id":"api","title":"API gateway","kind":"api","blurb":"One front door for both apps.","depth":1,"story":"Think of this as Shopify’s front desk. The app asks it for “what’s allowed / what’s next,” not for huge store pages. It routes, limits traffic, and hides internal stores."},{"id":"cdn","title":"CDN","kind":"cdn","blurb":"Photos, menus, and static maps tiles.","depth":1,"story":"On Shopify, bulky store pages are copied around the world. Play/browse should hit a nearby copy. If that copy is missing, a miss goes back to origin."},{"id":"auth","title":"Identity","kind":"auth","blurb":"Customer vs supply accounts.","depth":2,"story":"Before Shopify shows anything private, it checks who you are (account, session, device). A CDN copy of a file is not the same as being logged in."},{"id":"match","title":"Matching / search","kind":"service","blurb":"Who is nearby and available.","depth":2,"story":"Who is nearby and free? Shopify treats matching as its own service because location and availability change every second."},{"id":"pricing","title":"Pricing","kind":"service","blurb":"Quote, surge, fees.","depth":2,"story":"The quote you see (including busy-area pricing) is computed, not a single frozen number in a spreadsheet."},{"id":"geo","title":"Location service","kind":"service","blurb":"Pings, ETAs inputs, geofences — high write rate.","depth":3,"story":"Phones send location often. Shopify needs a geo index — a normal list of users would be too slow to search by “near me.”"},{"id":"eta","title":"ETA service","kind":"service","blurb":"Turns pings + traffic into “arrives in 4 min.”","depth":3,"story":"“Arrives in 4 min” is estimated from pings and traffic. That is its own job, not a random guess in the matching service."},{"id":"cache","title":"Hot cache + geo index","kind":"cache","blurb":"Open supply and popular listings, queried constantly.","depth":3,"story":"The same questions get asked thousands of times (session, “is this still available?”). Shopify keeps those answers in fast memory so the main database is not hit every time."},{"id":"tripdb","title":"Orders / trips DB","kind":"db","blurb":"The live job and its state machine.","depth":4,"story":"The live trip or order and its states (requested → assigned → done). Different from the catalog of what you can buy."},{"id":"listdb","title":"Catalog / listings DB","kind":"db","blurb":"What can be bought or booked.","depth":4,"story":"Homes, menu items, products — the catalog. Pictures of them live elsewhere."},{"id":"blob","title":"Media store","kind":"blob","blurb":"Listing and food photos.","depth":4,"story":"The warehouse for large store pages. Cheap to store, not great for “show my last 20 items.” Shopify points at these files from the records database."},{"id":"queue","title":"Dispatch queue","kind":"queue","blurb":"Notify supply without blocking checkout.","depth":5,"story":"Slow leftover work (encode, notify, payout) waits here after you already succeeded at checkout. The tap can return; workers finish later."},{"id":"pay","title":"Payments","kind":"workers","blurb":"Authorize, capture, payout.","depth":5,"story":"Money moves after the tap. Shopify should not freeze the app while banks respond."},{"id":"notify","title":"Push / SMS","kind":"workers","blurb":"“Your driver is here.”","depth":6,"story":"“New episode” or “your driver is here” is a background ping. It is not part of the Play / tap request that already succeeded."},{"id":"maps","title":"Maps / routing","kind":"service","blurb":"Turn-by-turn and distance.","depth":6,"story":"Turn-by-turn is a map/routing product sitting next to Shopify, not something every phone computes from scratch with no server."},{"id":"promo","title":"Promos / credits","kind":"service","blurb":"Coupons on the quote — not only in the app.","depth":2,"story":"Coupons and credits on Shopify are rules on the quote — they should not live only in the app where people can cheat."},{"id":"sale-guard","title":"Flash-sale guard","kind":"service","blurb":"Protects inventory and checkout from overselling during a sudden spike.","depth":6,"story":"Protects inventory and checkout from overselling during a sudden spike."}],"edges":[{"from":"client","to":"api","label":"search / order"},{"from":"supply","to":"api","label":"go online"},{"from":"client","to":"cdn","label":"photos"},{"from":"api","to":"auth","label":"who is this"},{"from":"api","to":"match","label":"find supply"},{"from":"api","to":"pricing","label":"quote"},{"from":"match","to":"geo","label":"where is everyone"},{"from":"match","to":"cache","label":"open supply"},{"from":"pricing","to":"cache","label":"hot prices"},{"from":"geo","to":"eta","label":"compute arrival"},{"from":"eta","to":"cache","label":"hot ETAs"},{"from":"match","to":"tripdb","label":"create job"},{"from":"match","to":"listdb","label":"what’s listed"},{"from":"cdn","to":"blob","label":"origin photos"},{"from":"api","to":"queue","label":"after tap"},{"from":"queue","to":"notify","label":"wake supply"},{"from":"queue","to":"pay","label":"charge later"},{"from":"pricing","to":"pay","label":"amount"},{"from":"geo","to":"maps","label":"route"},{"from":"pricing","to":"promo","label":"apply credit"},{"from":"queue","to":"sale-guard","label":"serialize scarce stock"}],"stages":[{"i":0,"blurb":"Two apps (customer and driver/host) share one front door. Photos already come from a nearby CDN.","unlockNodeIds":["client","supply","